Package: com.cfluid.cardash.v3
Name: CarDash V3 Native Beta
Version: 3.0.0~beta.5+https.3.open.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Tweaks
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), libssl3, uikittools, mobilesubstrate
Maintainer: cfluid
Author: cfluid
Homepage: https://github.com/cfluid101/cardash-beta
Description: Experimental native CarPlay video, touch and audio beta for rootless arm64 devices. No installer model or firmware allowlist. Native adapters check framework compatibility before patching; installation does not establish session support. Preserves original CarDash and V2 settings.
